WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:02.820
Good morning, John. Today I discovered that
people don't look at you funny if you’re

00:00:02.820 --> 00:00:06.120
in an airport vlogging and you're talking
on the phone at the same time, so I’m just

00:00:06.120 --> 00:00:08.420
going to pretend like we’re talking on the
phone.

00:00:08.420 --> 00:00:11.560
This isn’t actually my video for today;
I’m actually making a pre-made video because

00:00:11.560 --> 00:00:15.690
I want to talk about a new thing that we are
going to be doing. See, YouTube has decided

00:00:15.690 --> 00:00:21.180
to let us into the little livestreaming party,
and so we are going to join them and start

00:00:21.180 --> 00:00:25.699
doing livestreams. And we’re going to start
that today. Today is the official launch of

00:00:25.699 --> 00:00:29.689
YouTube.com/live, which is where you will
be able to find YouTube livestreams, and John

00:00:29.689 --> 00:00:32.920
and I are going to be doing that, and I am
very excited. John is doing a show today from

00:00:32.920 --> 00:00:37.720
2:30 to 4:30 Eastern time. I think that you
should come, and whoever’s on the phone,

00:00:37.720 --> 00:00:39.330
on the other end of the phone, I think they
should come too.

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:42.570
In these livestreams, John and I are going
to be talking about, ah, you know, well, nerdy

00:00:42.570 --> 00:00:46.820
things. John’s gonna read nineteenth century
poetry and I’m gonna talk about theoretical

00:00:46.820 --> 00:00:50.300
physics, and we’re gonna browse Reddit together,
and we’re gonna read books and play songs,

00:00:50.300 --> 00:00:56.720
and it’s gonna be fun! So, check out John’s
livestream, 2:30 to 4:30, at youtube.com/vlogbrothers,

00:00:56.720 --> 00:00:59.640
which is our YouTube channel, and we will
be doing more of them in the future. I hope

00:00:59.640 --> 00:01:00.640
that you enjoy them!

00:01:00.640 --> 00:01:01.690
John, you will see me later today.

